<h1>What's new</h1>

<p>This page lists what's changed over the last six months, newest first: what's in <em>Check our beta</em>, then what's on the Main Channel.</p>

<p>We release each new feature and fix to <a href="/help/beta-channel/"><em>Check our beta</em></a> as soon as it's ready, so every change gets its own version. The Main Channel gets them in batches, once they've settled in on <em>Check our beta</em>.</p>

<div id="whats-new-list">
<noscript><style>#whats-new-beta-status { display: none; }</style></noscript>
<h2>Check our beta</h2>
<div id="whats-new-beta">
<div id="whats-new-beta-status">{% loadingSpinner "Checking Check our beta", true %}</div>
</div>
<h2>Main Channel</h2>
<div id="whats-new-main">
{% for month in whatsNew %}
<h3>{{ month.month }}</h3>
<ul>
  {%- for release in month.releases %}{% for change in release.changes %}
  <li>{{ change }} <span class="block text-sm text-muted tabular-nums">{{ release.day }} · {{ release.version }}</span></li>
  {%- endfor %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>Nothing to show yet.</p>
{% endfor %}
</div>
</div>
